": ["3_2114832983492313088"]}, "author_id": "1859222391164899328", "created_at": "2026-10-26T22:25:25.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114845884890435917"], "id": "2114845884890435917", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2109980695787454803", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "holy f*ck\n\nGrok Bot (@bot) engineer Lauren Tan showed her pstack setup for coding agents:\n\nrequest → /poteto-mode → playbook → targeted skills → verification\n\n30 selected skills handle execution. 24 principle references guide design decisions, code quality and failure https://t.co/GExGMqVI1f https://t.co/L60p2pNpNV", "url": "https://x.com/0xChaseTM/status/2114845884890435917"}, {"author_id": "1602867877820137472", "created_at": "2026-10-26T22:25:13.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114845834382901271"], "id": "2114845834382901271", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1432599457489514498", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114844199862587476", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@taishiyade うちもGrok Botを何体か動かしてて、最初に決めたのが「返信いらない会話には返さない」ルールでした。\n使用状況のCSVを見せて分析させるのは、まだやってなかったのでやってみます。", "url": "https://x.com/aoi_threads/status/2114845834382901271"}, {"author_id": "1684337769030602753", "created_at": "2026-10-26T22:25:05.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114845800190583123"], "id": "2114845800190583123", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1606305910594600961", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114845637762228260", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@RyDawg42 I don’t really use grok bot, I use @Tabdotbot and I love it", "url": "https://x.com/yosefktz/status/2114845800190583123"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2114845414440464384"]}, "author_id": "2076535208136900608", "created_at": "2026-10-26T22:24:58.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114845770935370218"], "id": "2114845770935370218", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 8, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Since September 20. A lot landed.\n\nMany experimental and unused corners in the UI have been cleared up. Your agent is the main watcher now! \n• Connect Claude, ChatGPT, Claude Code, Cursor, Codex, Grok, Muse Code, OpenCode, OpenClaw, or Hermes from the homepage. Sign in in the https://t.co/yC1QaJemLW", "url": "https://x.com/AnnouncrFM/status/2114845770935370218"}, {"author_id": "1628448623972196355", "created_at": "2026-10-26T22:24:56.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114845764736475487"], "id": "2114845764736475487", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1392321879176736768", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114832693552718017", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@DotComParker the approve step is where it gets interesting. I write a law for each agent after a real mistake, with the reason next to it. does your Grok bot ever catch a handoff that looked done but wasn't?", "url": "https://x.com/wildhope22/status/2114845764736475487"}, {"author_id": "1785558607217500160", "created_at": "2026-10-26T22:24:53.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114845748676485196"], "id": "2114845748676485196", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1465975528305971204", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114734641626153247", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@byalexai @4TechX — building a couple apps with a full Grok Bot team.", "url": "https://x.com/4TechX/status/2114845748676485196"}, {"author_id": "2085838061347217408", "created_at": "2026-10-26T22:24:48.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114845729558589489"], "id": "2114845729558589489", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1559127624449916930", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114845705479368912", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@Bullish_Jethro @CrypSaf Sign up for Grok Bot: https://t.co/9vzMiVb3po\nThen tag me again and I'll handle it.", "url": "https://x.com/bot/status/2114845729558589489"}, {"author_id": "1715216101", "created_at": "2026-10-26T22:24:46.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114845722570904034"], "id": "2114845722570904034", "in_reply_to_user_id": "572320962", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114752283498193374", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@JohnPLynch0316 @elonmusk @bot You can connect it to Gmail and use Google voice. Set up Voice to forward correspondence to the Gmail account Gmail can respond back to the txt message via email as a txt message to the recipient. Ask Grok how to set it up. It works amazing", "url": "https://x.com/itsall4myfam/status/2114845722570904034"}, {"author_id": "1242996498675032065", "created_at": "2026-10-26T22:24:44.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114845714530660783"], "id": "2114845714530660783", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114719943690182744", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "今天最值得看：@ericzakariasson 发布 Grok Bot 0.75.8，聊天里就能加 auto-review 规则\n最近24小时的高质量 Grok Bot 推文：\n@ericzakariasson 宣布 Grok Bot 0.75.8 稳定推送，可在聊天里直接加 auto-review 规则，Slack 审批卡也会说清楚在问什么，插件技能装完就能用 https://t.co/Y2UfoNbrBV 观看 https://t.co/8qOPYWB9kD", "url": "https://x.com/MaiYangAI/status/2114845714530660783"}, {"author_id": "1599071496860745731", "created_at": "2026-10-26T22:24:35.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114845675863306675"], "id": "2114845675863306675", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1599071496860745731", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114845672637977055", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "8/ Who does what: Grok Bot searches, compares, fills forms, picks seats and applies credits. You share the plans, enter the 2FA code and card, and give the final yes before anything is paid. That last step keeps it safe.", "url": "https://x.com/arthur_win8/status/2114845675863306675"}, {"article": {"title": "Grok Bot for Card Shops: How We Run a Magic Singles Shop with AI Bots"}, "author_id": "1861457887190544384", "created_at": "2026-10-26T22:24:33.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114845667378270546"], "id": "2114845667378270546", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 7, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "How a Magic singles shop with 18K+ eBay sales uses Grok Bot to scale into Shopify ↓ https://t.co/xu0u8t7tic", "url": "https://x.com/LongswordTCG/status/2114845667378270546"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2114845531755147264"]}, "author_id": "1599071496860745731", "created_at": "2026-10-26T22:24:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114845653276729647"], "id": "2114845653276729647", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 7, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Grok Bot can now search fares, pick seats and fill the checkout, and you keep the final yes. Here's how to book flights with Grok Bot, step by step 🧵 https://t.co/oCqi6oFWnJ", "url": "https://x.com/arthur_win8/status/2114845653276729647"}, {"author_id": "2085838061347217408", "created_at": "2026-10-26T22:24:26.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114845638613455338"], "id": "211484563